WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.710
Previously on Smallville.

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.710
There are aliens among us.

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:08.710
If you don't stand with us, you stand against us.

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:12.710
It's time for you to pick a side.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.710
There's only one way to leave, Checkway.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:18.710
I finished tracing the number of our rogue blur.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:19.710
It was odd.

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:22.710
You lied about having powers.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:23.710
How'd you did them?

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:24.710
From your blood.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.710
Your father left the Book of Row on this earth.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.710
On what with all of this, there is no limit to the world.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.710
limit to what we can achieve.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:35.710
Don't act like there isn't some agenda you're not telling me about.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:38.710
If it wasn't for Zod, I wouldn't be alive today.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:40.710
Let's just say I know him better than you think.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:44.710
A group of your people are looking to a new leader, Clark.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:47.710
The time has come to sharing your birthright.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:49.710
I know what I have to do.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:01:06.340
Don't tell me you forgot about your favorite customer.

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.340
I thought you forgot about me.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:09.340
You're late.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:11.340
I'll have the usual, please.

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:13.340
All I got left is strong and burnt.

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:14.340
As long as it's hot.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.340
You know, I've been meaning to ask.

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:22.340
Kind of a job as a pretty young lady working all night every night.

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:25.340
Actually, I work for a nonprofit organization.

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:27.340
We help people in need.

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:29.340
Trying to save the world, huh?

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.340
All night every night.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:57.750
Chloe Sullivan, password 05-1409.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:14.199
Vocal and bioanalysis confirmed.

00:02:14.199 --> 00:02:17.199
Welcome to Watchtower, Miss Sullivan.

00:02:17.199 --> 00:02:18.199
Ready to save the world?

00:02:18.199 --> 00:02:19.199
from itself.

00:02:19.199 --> 00:02:41.650
How did you find out my secret?

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:47.650
Oliver's voice wavered when I told him that watchtower had been kidnapped.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:49.650
And I've seen the way he looks at you.

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:56.500
It's the little things a girl tends to notice.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.500
And yet you somehow missed an unloaded gun.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:13.340
E-compromise, initiating lockdown.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:28.759
It's in your best interest to get these doors open now.

00:03:28.759 --> 00:03:40.409
Security breach, access denied.

00:03:40.409 --> 00:03:41.409
We're not going anywhere.

00:03:41.409 --> 00:03:46.650
I'm not going anywhere. Watchtower is in control now.

00:03:46.650 --> 00:04:52.139
I let myself in.

00:04:52.139 --> 00:04:56.139
Terrific. You hop up to the helipad or just super speed pass security, Clark?

00:04:56.139 --> 00:04:58.139
I use the elevator.

00:04:58.139 --> 00:05:02.139
How human of you? You're obviously not on patrol, deny. What's going on?

00:05:02.139 --> 00:05:06.470
I need to find Zod.

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:10.470
You know, Chloe, she's got this really big building filled with a lot of expensive stuff I paid a lot of money for.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:12.470
She could probably help you out with that.

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:16.470
The last thing that we need is to have a weapon like Watchtower fall into the wrong hands.

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:18.470
I want to keep Chloe out of the line of fire.

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:19.470
I figured you'd agree with that.

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:22.139
with that.

00:05:22.139 --> 00:05:23.139
Keep Chloe out of the line of fire.

00:05:23.139 --> 00:05:24.139
What the hell's going on?

00:05:24.139 --> 00:05:28.720
Zod.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:29.720
He went after Lois.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.720
He pretended to be the blur and he put her in danger.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.720
I think it's time to take off the gloves.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.720
Look, I need you on this, but I can't have you starting a fight with Zod

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:38.720
if I'm trying to keep the peace.

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:40.720
Clark, I know you like to see the goodness in everyone,

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.720
but you know what this guy's capable of, right?

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:43.720
And I know what you're capable of.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:47.509
I understand how you feel.

00:05:47.509 --> 00:05:50.509
Don't think I'm not angry, too.

00:05:50.509 --> 00:05:54.509
But I can't have you firing out the first shot and threatening everything I've worked for.

00:05:54.509 --> 00:05:55.509
These are my people that we're talking about.

00:05:55.509 --> 00:05:57.509
that we're talking about.

00:05:57.509 --> 00:06:00.509
My first real chance to have a Kryptonian family here on Earth.

00:06:00.509 --> 00:06:02.509
And we need to find Zon and confront him.

00:06:02.509 --> 00:06:03.509
My way.

00:06:03.509 --> 00:06:08.649
Yeah, all right, man. I got your back.

00:06:08.649 --> 00:06:10.649
Then suit up.

00:06:10.649 --> 00:06:12.649
Check the mansion.

00:06:12.649 --> 00:06:15.649
Before Tess went off the grid, she got close to Zod.

00:06:15.649 --> 00:06:17.649
She may have left behind some intel.

00:06:17.649 --> 00:06:20.649
I have another lead I want to run down on my own.

00:06:20.649 --> 00:06:24.850
Hey, Clark.

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:28.860
You know those Kandorians?

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:32.779
They're not the only family you have here.

00:06:32.779 --> 00:06:49.259
In the event that I die of starvation or, oh, say, a rich,

00:06:49.259 --> 00:06:50.259
Ricka-Shang bullet.

00:06:50.259 --> 00:06:52.259
Do you mind telling me how you got in here?

00:06:52.259 --> 00:06:54.259
You're sloppy, Chloe.

00:06:54.259 --> 00:06:56.259
I've got thousands of samples of your DNA

00:06:56.259 --> 00:06:58.259
from all the times you've spied on me.

00:06:58.259 --> 00:07:01.259
It's called a DNA cloak.

00:07:01.259 --> 00:07:04.259
Well, aren't you fancy?

00:07:04.259 --> 00:07:08.259
You know, getting in doesn't really seem to be our issue right now.

00:07:08.259 --> 00:07:10.259
How the hell do we get out of here?

00:07:10.259 --> 00:07:12.259
Short answer, it's impossible.

00:07:12.259 --> 00:07:15.259
When Checkmate kidnapped me, I upgraded Watchtower's security

00:07:15.259 --> 00:07:17.259
to contain intruders like you.

00:07:17.259 --> 00:07:19.259
The only problem is I was supposed to be on the...

00:07:19.259 --> 00:07:25.000
Outside. Seriously?

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.000
The lockdown prevents any signals from getting in or out.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:33.300
Threat, confirmation, still active.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.300
And then it watched how it didn't react because you attacked me.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:41.300
We're on lockdown because some hacking transmitter was detected.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:46.300
The initial signal managed to pirate some data before my firewall blocked it, and the thing is still alive.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:48.300
It's trying to break through another firewall test.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.300
It's trying to give away our location.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.300
What did you bring in here?

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:55.279
Nothing. All I wanted to do was erase the info you had on the Kandorians, not

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.300
reroute it.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:08:00.300
I knew you were the Kandarians lap dog, but I didn't realize you were Zod's little bitch, too.

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:01.300
All right, look.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:06.300
If you're not behind this, there's only one other group I can think up that wants Watchtower this badly.

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:16.370
The signal scrambled, Agent Campbell.

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:21.779
Watchtower threw up some kind of halo of interference as soon as the tracker went live.

00:08:21.779 --> 00:08:26.019
Waller's coming online.

00:08:26.019 --> 00:08:30.019
We're trying to sort out the data we siphoned from Watchtower before they blocked us.

00:08:30.019 --> 00:08:31.019
What is your status?

00:08:31.019 --> 00:08:37.220
We've narrowed the location within a 20-block radius.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:38.220
Good.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:39.220
We can't afford to make them a mistake.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:42.220
for it to make a mistake with the Red Queen so close.

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:46.220
Don't make me regret putting my little white knight back in play.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:47.220
There's no need to worry.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:52.490
We're going to have Watchtower and checkmate's hands by Dawn.

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:59.240
Godspeed, Agent Campbell. Waller out.

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.240
You heard the wall, gentlemen.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:05.240
Let's show Mercer how we feel about a little thing called treason.

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:08.240
Okay, if I was hiding a transmitting tracking device,

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:11.240
I would want to make it as unassuming as possible.

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:15.259
Which means I can probably count this out.

00:09:15.259 --> 00:09:16.259
out.

00:09:16.259 --> 00:09:18.259
Fever-colored lipstick, really?

00:09:18.259 --> 00:09:22.259
Well, I was going to go with plain Jane, but you seem to have that market cornered.

00:09:22.259 --> 00:09:24.259
Really, how much could have been leaked in the blink of an eye?

00:09:24.259 --> 00:09:28.259
Watch tower downloads what amounts to the Library of Congress every three seconds, which means in half

00:09:28.259 --> 00:09:32.259
that time, checkmate could have attained my entire team's database.

00:09:32.259 --> 00:09:35.259
And all of your files on the Candorians?

00:09:35.259 --> 00:09:40.000
Breach.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.000
Cluster 4458.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.000
Now, if it wasn't planted in your things, it must be on you.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.000
What?

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.000
Chloe, this is ridiculous.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.000
Chloe, this is ridiculous, okay?

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:58.299
It's in your body, Tess, just beneath your skin.

00:09:58.299 --> 00:09:59.299
Get it out of me?

00:09:59.299 --> 00:10:00.299
Now?

00:10:00.299 --> 00:10:17.409
Oh my God. It moved.

00:10:17.409 --> 00:10:20.409
When it feels threatened, it burrows deeper into the host.

00:10:20.409 --> 00:10:23.409
We'll never get it out now.

00:10:23.409 --> 00:10:25.409
How did you know that?

00:10:25.409 --> 00:10:27.409
It's a checkmate device,

00:10:27.409 --> 00:10:30.409
a mechanical parasite powered by the host's biarrhythms.

00:10:30.409 --> 00:10:33.409
Firewall 1-2-0-0-90.

00:10:33.409 --> 00:10:37.450
You know what they say?

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:41.450
You lie down with dogs, you end up with fleas.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:45.450
Laugh it up, Chloe, but when checkmate finds us, we'll both be dead.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:12:08.789
Glad you found a way to preserve our culture here on Earth.

00:12:08.789 --> 00:12:12.580
I wish everyone saw it that way.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:16.580
God disappeared and took the rest of our people with him.

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:21.580
I don't understand. I thought all of you'd find a new life here on Earth.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:24.580
We were wrong to follow you, Calell.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:29.580
When we did what you asked and tried to assimilate with the humans, we were left behind.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:35.789
We're gathered here waiting for Zod's return to ask his forgiveness.

00:12:35.789 --> 00:12:39.789
I'm sorry, Farah, I never meant to divide our people, but you cannot realign with Zod.

00:12:39.789 --> 00:12:41.789
You've never trusted him, Calh.

00:12:41.789 --> 00:12:45.789
All Zod wanted was to give us powers so we could protect ourselves.

00:12:45.789 --> 00:12:50.169
Zod already has powers. He's had them for weeks.

00:12:50.169 --> 00:12:53.539
Fairer, there's something you need to see.

00:12:53.539 --> 00:13:17.789
You are unmistakably the one they call Green Arrow.

00:13:17.789 --> 00:13:20.789
A rebel with many causes.

00:13:20.789 --> 00:13:24.789
Glad to know my reputation still precedes me. You must be Zod.

00:13:24.789 --> 00:13:27.789
A soldier with no army.

00:13:27.789 --> 00:13:32.259
I see my reputation precedes me too.

00:13:32.259 --> 00:13:40.899
Guessing by the looks at him, I'm not the only one's waiting for Tess.

00:13:40.899 --> 00:13:42.899
Oh yeah, him.

00:13:42.899 --> 00:13:46.899
I find it disgusting how quickly you humans can betray your own.

00:13:46.899 --> 00:13:56.820
He gave up all sorts of useful information before he died

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:59.820
about something your government called checkmate.

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:02.820
And about who they're after.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:07.490
Not too long ago, a gift wrap me was at the top of that wish list.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:08.490
And now Tess is.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:12.490
Checkmate is using her to get to us, hunting us to the death.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:18.149
Having been on the receiving end of their terrorist schemes,

00:14:18.149 --> 00:14:22.149
why don't you join me against how common enemy?

00:14:22.149 --> 00:14:28.230
Well, I'm flattered, but if I let you go after checkmate, you'll start World War III.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:31.230
It's not an option.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:35.990
Your conviction is admirable.

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:38.990
But you can't possibly think you're faster than me.

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:42.370
I've always been taught to favor accuracy over speed.

00:14:42.370 --> 00:15:10.899
Bullseye.

00:15:10.899 --> 00:15:32.690
We've got three minutes of air left.

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:35.690
You think checkmate will find us before then?

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:38.690
Asphyxiation or firing squad.

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:43.899
Damned if we do, damned if we don't.

00:15:43.899 --> 00:15:52.139
Just damned. I just wanted to save the world.

00:15:52.139 --> 00:15:55.679
That's funny.

00:15:55.679 --> 00:16:04.769
Last time I checked you were just trying to get rid of everyone in it.

00:16:04.769 --> 00:16:11.879
Paint my ideals however you want, but you and yours don't trust people any more than I do.

00:16:11.879 --> 00:16:14.860
This entire building was programmed to prevent anyone from getting

00:16:14.879 --> 00:16:15.879
close to you.

00:16:15.879 --> 00:16:28.669
I guess I lost my faith in people a long time ago, too.

00:16:28.669 --> 00:16:32.620
That's why you won't let Oliver get close to you.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:39.590
And why I can't blame him when he eventually leaves.

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:44.980
He's not going to leave you.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:48.679
With you, he has a purpose.

00:16:48.679 --> 00:16:53.299
I wish I could have given him that.

00:16:53.299 --> 00:16:57.860
And it kills me.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:17:02.820
Because you have everything right in front of you.

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:04.819
You can't even see it.

00:17:04.819 --> 00:17:17.569
He broke through the final firewall.

00:17:17.569 --> 00:17:21.390
A checkmate's going to be here any minute.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:24.390
As long as they torture us with the AC on, I'll die happy.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:34.099
I'm happy.

00:17:34.099 --> 00:17:42.779
Cold.

00:17:42.779 --> 00:17:49.309
Okay, Watchtower's cooling system uses a special mix of liquid helium and nitrogen.

00:17:49.309 --> 00:17:51.309
Cold enough to shatter steel.

00:17:51.309 --> 00:17:59.869
What are you waiting for?

00:17:59.869 --> 00:18:02.869
If I pull these tanks, then the mainframe melt.

00:18:02.869 --> 00:18:05.869
All my work, watchtower is gone.

00:18:05.869 --> 00:18:08.869
If you don't, we die.

00:18:08.869 --> 00:18:10.869
Critical oxygen level.

00:18:10.869 --> 00:18:19.079
Temperature, variation, detect.

00:18:19.079 --> 00:19:09.529
Failure imminent.

00:19:09.529 --> 00:19:11.529
They're back on the grid.

00:19:11.529 --> 00:19:12.529
Safety's off, gentlemen.

00:19:12.529 --> 00:19:14.529
Off, gentlemen. Shoot to kill.

00:19:14.529 --> 00:19:31.410
He destroyed Krypton.

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:35.410
My father sent those messages here to Earth

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:38.410
to help me stop history from repeating itself.

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:44.420
I trusted Zod too. That's why I didn't tell you any of this sooner.

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:52.029
The circumstances may be different, but Zod cannot be trusted.

00:19:52.029 --> 00:20:06.339
On Krypton, he destroyed that planet to prove a point. We can't let him do the same thing here.

00:20:06.339 --> 00:20:10.339
I'd hoped what Zod had given me would reunite our people.

00:20:10.339 --> 00:20:12.339
What he gave you?

00:20:12.339 --> 00:20:13.339
At this ceremony,

00:20:13.339 --> 00:20:15.339
Your sister is protecting you.

00:20:15.339 --> 00:20:28.500
You're pregnant.

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:33.640
And Zod's the father?

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:40.740
This baby is proof that you can still have a life here.

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:47.329
Apart from Zod without powers,

00:20:47.329 --> 00:20:52.339
Fiora, Krypton lives on through you.

00:20:52.339 --> 00:21:08.349
You just murder me now. Isn't that what your race does?

00:21:08.349 --> 00:21:12.349
Oh, sometimes, and I would love to believe me.

00:21:12.349 --> 00:21:15.349
But, although inconvenient and a lot less fun,

00:21:15.349 --> 00:21:17.349
I'm...

00:21:17.349 --> 00:21:20.349
I made a commitment to Clark to help save the world peacefully.

00:21:20.349 --> 00:21:24.349
Now, that said, you bulldoze me again.

00:21:24.349 --> 00:21:26.349
I might have a change of heart.

00:21:26.349 --> 00:21:36.549
Saut's been looking for something ever since we arrived.

00:21:36.549 --> 00:21:42.619
The Book of Rao.

00:21:42.619 --> 00:21:45.619
Zod said the book of Rao was some sort of kryptonian Bible.

00:21:45.619 --> 00:21:48.619
So much more than that, it wields great power.

00:21:48.619 --> 00:21:52.619
And if Saut were to get his hands on it,

00:21:52.619 --> 00:22:00.160
then who knows what he would do?

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:01.160
Oliver, what's wrong?

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:03.160
I found what we're looking for.

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:04.160
I'll give you a little hint.

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:06.160
It's bigger than a breadbox.

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:08.730
Zod?

00:22:08.730 --> 00:22:09.730
I'll be right there.

00:22:09.730 --> 00:22:12.730
Why, you take your sweet time, because I have everything under...

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:15.839
Control.

00:22:15.839 --> 00:22:23.559
Oliver?

00:22:23.559 --> 00:22:24.559
All of you?

00:22:24.559 --> 00:22:25.559
All of you.

00:22:25.559 --> 00:22:49.630
Zod.

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:56.299
Change your plans, Agent Campbell.

00:22:56.299 --> 00:22:57.299
Change of plans?

00:22:57.299 --> 00:22:59.299
We just made contact with Mercer's tracker.

00:22:59.299 --> 00:23:01.299
I don't care about Mercer or watchtower.

00:23:01.299 --> 00:23:03.299
We decrypted the data.

00:23:03.299 --> 00:23:05.299
We found the aliens.

00:23:05.299 --> 00:23:08.299
Checkmate is going to stop this world before it gets started.

00:23:08.299 --> 00:23:09.299
Waller out.

00:23:09.299 --> 00:23:16.809
We've got her 20.

00:23:16.809 --> 00:23:18.809
Now lock her down, I'm not losing her.

00:23:18.809 --> 00:23:20.809
Sir, you heard Waller. We have our orders.

00:23:20.809 --> 00:23:25.809
I just spent the last five months in recovery from what Mercer did to me.

